          <p>{item.body}</p>
          <div class="checkpoint__note">{item.note}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="lifestyle">The lifestyle and family trade-offs, honestly</h2>

  <p>
    A defence services career India delivers real stability, respect, and structure — but it also asks for
    things most desk-job career comparisons never mention. Here is the part worth sitting with before you
    commit years of preparation.
  </p>

  <div class="feature-grid">
    {lifestyleAnchors.map((item) => (
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__label">{item.label}</div>
        <div class="feature-card__title">{item.title}</div>
        <p>{item.body}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      None of these trade-offs are reasons to avoid a defence career if it genuinely fits you. They are
      reasons to stop treating the decision as "can I clear the exam" and start treating it as "can I and
      my family sustain this rhythm for a decade or more." People who skip that second question are the
      ones who struggle mid-career, not the ones who fail the SSB.
    </p>
  </div>

